      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Interpretation of the Before/After Validation\n",
        "\n",
        "The Week-5 random split produced the original benchmark.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Week-6 grouped split provides a stricter test because observations from the same client cannot appear in both training and testing.\n",
        "\n",
        "The purpose of this comparison is not to select whichever split produces the highest score. The grouped result is useful because it gives a more conservative indication of how the model behaves when client-level overlap is removed.\n",
        "\n",
        "The comparison should therefore be interpreted as a validation audit rather than proof of future performance.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Week-5 baseline remains the primary benchmark because it was the original decision-support method, while the grouped evaluation tests whether the Logistic Regression result remains reasonable under a stricter split."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YbAzqsVR-jnq"
      },
      "id": "YbAzqsVR-jnq"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 3. Leakage Audit\n",
        "\n",
        "I audited the final feature set for information that would not legitimately be available as an input.\n",
        "\n",
        "The final predictive features are:\n",
        "\n",
        "- `days_since_last_update`\n",
        "- `impressions_90d`\n",
        "- `avg_position`\n",
        "- `ctr`\n",
        "\n",
        "The following fields are deliberately excluded.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `trend_direction`\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the observed outcome. Including it as a feature would directly leak the answer into the model.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `trend_pct`\n",
        "\n",
        "This is an outcome-related trend measure and is therefore excluded from the predictive feature set.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `client_id`\n",
        "\n",
        "This is not used as a model feature. It is used only to create the grouped validation split.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Future-window information\n",
        "\n",
        "No future performance fields are used as model inputs.\n",
        "\n",
        "The final model therefore uses current-state signals only."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "PzsY6qhf-lre"
      },
      "id": "PzsY6qhf-lre"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "print(\"Final model features:\")\n",
        "for feature in features:\n",
        "    print(\"-\", feature)\n",
        "\n",
        "excluded_fields = [\n",
        "    \"trend_direction\",\n",
        "    \"trend_pct\",\n",
        "    \"client_id\"\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nExcluded fields:\")\n",
        "for field in excluded_fields:\n",
        "    print(\"-\", field)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nLeakage checks:\")\n",
