        "\n",
        "## Capstone Research Paper\n",
        "\n",
        "This project investigates whether current-state search and content signals can be used to prioritize potentially declining content for human review.\n",
        "\n",
        "The analysis compares a transparent rule-based baseline with Logistic Regression and then evaluates the model under a stricter client-grouped validation design.\n",
        "\n",
        "The project is intended as decision support rather than an automated content optimizer or a causal model of search performance."
      ],
