        "# 2. My Model Under an Honest Split\n",
        "\n",
        "My Week-5 experiment used a stratified random 80/20 split.\n",
        "\n",
        "That split is useful as an initial benchmark, but it can be optimistic if multiple observations from the same client appear on both sides of the split.\n",
        "\n",
        "For this audit, I use a client-grouped split.\n",
        "\n",
        "The purpose is to test a stricter generalization scenario in which observations belonging to the same client are kept together.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Week-5 random split is the **before** result.\n",
        "\n",
        "The grouped-by-client evaluation is the **after** result.\n",
        "\n",
        "Client ID is used only to create the validation groups. It is not used as a predictive feature."
