      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 3. Leakage Audit\n",
        "\n",
        "I audited the final feature set for information that would not legitimately be available as an input.\n",
        "\n",
        "The final predictive features are:\n",
        "\n",
        "- `days_since_last_update`\n",
        "- `impressions_90d`\n",
        "- `avg_position`\n",
        "- `ctr`\n",
        "\n",
        "The following fields are deliberately excluded.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `trend_direction`\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the observed outcome. Including it as a feature would directly leak the answer into the model.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `trend_pct`\n",
        "\n",
        "This is an outcome-related trend measure and is therefore excluded from the predictive feature set.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `client_id`\n",
        "\n",
        "This is not used as a model feature. It is used only to create the grouped validation split.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Future-window information\n",
        "\n",
        "No future performance fields are used as model inputs.\n",
        "\n",
        "The final model therefore uses current-state signals only."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "PzsY6qhf-lre"
      },
      "id": "PzsY6qhf-lre"
    },
