      "source": [
        "# Final Takeaway\n",
        "\n",
        "A model does not need to win to be useful.\n",
        "\n",
        "The important outcome of this project was the process:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Define an explicit outcome.\n",
        "2. Build a transparent baseline.\n",
        "3. Compare a more complex model against that baseline.\n",
        "4. Evaluate both using the same ranking metrics.\n",
        "5. Inspect model errors.\n",
        "6. Audit the feature set for leakage.\n",
        "7. Test a stricter client-grouped validation design.\n",
        "8. Rewrite claims so they match the evidence.\n",
        "\n",
        "The final result is a repeatable content-review prioritization approach that provides **directional decision-support evidence** while keeping a human reviewer responsible for the final decision."
